# Beside the lab wall (lab-wallride), the grind pressed 9 ticks before the first air tick (101), on
# the ground during the crouch: inside combo.wallPressTicks (10), so the wall takes it at once.
# lab-wallride-early-press: 10 ticks is too early for a wall.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -27.3 -9 0.14 0
hold up 6..90
hold ollie 80..100
tap grind 92
run 400
expect event wallrideStart within 102..102
expect event comboLanded{name=Wallride} within 140..320
expect no event bail
